# The agent runner's direct dependencies. requirements.txt is the pinned resolution that gets
# installed; regenerate both it and THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md with `make deps-lock third-party`
# from the repository root.

# Each agent's loop (app/agent.py). Runs, task graphs and scheduling are the runner's own code.
